# {{PROJECT}} · Directory ownership

> **Only change directories you own.** For cross-directory work, write `BLOCKED:` in your report naming who should
> change what, and hand it back to the PM. Anything not listed here belongs to the PM.

| Path | Owner | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `<path>/**` | agent:<name> | <what this directory is responsible for> |
| `docs/**` | PM | Briefs / reports / verification / decisions |
| `.pi/**`, `AGENTS.md` | PM | Team protocol and configuration |
| `scripts/team*`, root config (lockfile/tsconfig, ...) | PM | New dependencies → raise them in the report |

## Roster

| Agent | Model | Long-lived worktree | Scope |
|---|---|---|---|
| <name> | <provider/model> | `.worktrees/<name>` | <module> |

## Change process

1. Need a new directory? The PM updates this file (and references it in the brief).
2. Temporary borrowing (e.g. one package handled by another agent for a phase) must be marked **temporary** in the
   brief together with the hand-over condition.
